## Computing the CI for the slope II {.smaller}

Take `100` bootstrap samples and fit models to each one:


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code  code-line-numbers="1,5,6"}
set.seed(1120)

boot_fits <- duke_forest |>
  specify(price ~ area) |>
  generate(reps = 100, type = "bootstrap") |>
  fit()

boot_fits
```

